<title>JAPAN: Sony up sharply on firm group profits.</title>
<headline>Sony up sharply on firm group profits.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sony Corp shares rose sharply on Thursday morning after it announced strong consolidated business results for the third quarter of fiscal 1996/97, dealers said.</p>
<p>At 0010 GMT the shares were up 150 yen at 8,370.</p>
